WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
Ask about an uploaded PDF

2
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:07.735
Click the actions button on the PDF row

3
00:00:07.735 --> 00:00:12.985
Choose Ask about this document

4
00:00:12.985 --> 00:00:20.555
Enter your question about the document

5
00:00:20.555 --> 00:00:23.420
Click the send button

6
00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:31.455
The system answers from the document with reference numbers

7
00:00:31.455 --> 00:00:33.955
Done
